# ── graphify ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep GRAPH_REPORT.md, graph.json, graph.html and cost.json: rebuilding the graph costs
# real tokens, so the built index is worth versioning. Drop the machine-local state —
# these hold absolute paths from whichever machine last ran the build.
graphify-out/.graphify_python
graphify-out/.graphify_root
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/manifest.json

